'''Unearthed Artifacts''' (暴かれし神殿の秘宝, ''Abakareshi Shinden no Hihō'', '''Discovered Temple Treasures''') is the 23rd sub-chapter of [[Uncanny Legends]] and the 72nd sub-chapter overall. It was added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This chapter is about as difficult as [[Drunken Foundry]], or even a lot more difficult than [[Drunken Foundry]], especially [[Brave Dog's Bone]] and [[Patience Prevails]]. It features a lot of [[Omni Strike]], [[Wave Attack|Wave]] and [[Long Distance]] enemies, making it particularly tricky for many players. Most stages here are remakes of ones seen in [[Silk Road]].
{{LegendDiff|130|170|100}}

